### Estimate - toyota corolla, Toronto, 2018
GET http://localhost:3000/reports?make=toyota&model=corolla&year=2018&mileage=50000&lng=-79.38&lat=43.65

### Estimate - toyota camry, Toronto, 2018 (different model, same make)
GET http://localhost:3000/reports?make=toyota&model=camry&year=2018&mileage=50000&lng=-79.38&lat=43.65

### Estimate - honda civic, Toronto, 2018 (different make)
GET http://localhost:3000/reports?make=honda&model=civic&year=2018&mileage=50000&lng=-79.38&lat=43.65

### Estimate - ford f150, Toronto, 2020 (only one match)
GET http://localhost:3000/reports?make=ford&model=f150&year=2020&mileage=30000&lng=-79.38&lat=43.65

### Estimate - toyota corolla, Vancouver (different location, should only use the Vancouver report)
GET http://localhost:3000/reports?make=toyota&model=corolla&year=2018&mileage=50000&lng=-123.12&lat=49.28

### Estimate - toyota corolla, Toronto, 2010 (old year, should only use the 2010 report)
GET http://localhost:3000/reports?make=toyota&model=corolla&year=2010&mileage=180000&lng=-79.38&lat=43.65

### Estimate - no matching make (expect price null)
GET http://localhost:3000/reports?make=bmw&model=x5&year=2018&mileage=50000&lng=-79.38&lat=43.65
